# CHANGE.log

Running record of what shipped and who sent it, newest first, with a verified,
linkable X profile per contributor. Public thanks without the @ means the person
never sees it, and a wrong @ tags a stranger, so every handle here was verified
rather than guessed. Where nothing verified, this file says so outright instead
of leaving a blank.

Verification order used per person: `gh api users/<login> --jq .twitter_username`,
`gh api users/<login>/social_accounts`, then their own site or blog. A live
personal site beats a GitHub profile field when the two disagree, because the
field is written once at signup and never revisited.

Started 2026-09-18 at the #36 merge. Entries before that are listed under
Backfill pending; the release history itself is in CHANGELOG.md.

